architecture.h4_f:
msg = CBOR{v:1, nkyerɛwee, mmuae_ma, wɔde amena_wɔ}
ct = AES-GCM-256-Encrypt (k, nonce, msg, aad = dan_id) Ɔde ne nsa kyerɛɛ ne so, na ɔde ne nsa kyerɛɛ ne so bio.
POST /api/dan/{id}/nkrasɛm {ciphertext: hex (ct), nonce: hex}

auth.h1_f:
POST /api/nokwaredi/kyerɛw din
  { ɔdefo din, asɛmfua, x25519_ɔmanfo_safoa, ɔyɛkyerɛ_din, telefon?, email?, avatar_emoji }

Mmuae 201 Wɔabɔ:
  { access_token, refresh_token, ɔdefo_id, ɔdefo din, ... }

auth.h3_f:
access_token a ɛyɛ adwuma:
  { sub: ɔdefoɔ_id, jti: mfiri_id, typ: "kwan a wɔfa so kɔ", exp: seesei + 15min }
refresh_token mfasoɔ a ɛwɔ mu:
  { sub: ɔdefoɔ_id, jti: mfiri_id, typ: "san yɛ foforɔ", exp: seesei + 30d }

HS256-signed ne node no 64-byte ahintasɛm a efi .env

rooms.h6_f:
sender_pseudo = HMAC-SHA256 (dan_atoro_nkyene, ɔsomafo_id) [: 16] // 32 hex
ciphertext = AES-GCM-Encrypt (dan_safoa, nonce, CBOR_payload, aad = dan_id)

Fan-out frame: { type:"m", dan, msg:{id, ct, nonce, ɔdemafo_pseudo, ɔsoma_wɔ} }

files.h2_f:
init POST /api/fael/wɔbɛtumi asan ahyɛ aseɛ/init {fael din, kɛseɛ, chunk_size_hint}
            ← {upload_id, chunk_kɛse}
chunk PUT /api/fael/wɔbɛsan de adi dwuma/{upload_id}/chunk/{offset} <ct baiti>
            ← 204 na ɛwɔ hɔ
wie POST /api/fael/wɔbɛsan de ahyɛ ase/{upload_id}/awie {plain_blake3}
            ← 201 {fael_id, url} .
TTL wɔ nea wonwiei so: 24 h

presence.h1_f:
client: wɔ keystroke a edi kan so → soma {type:"t", state:"fi ase"}
         no bio nsoma mma 3 s gye sɛ ɔman no sesa
         10 s akyi safoa a etwa to a wobɛbɔ → soma {type:"t", state:"stop"}
receiver: auto-stop 10 s akyi "fi ase" a etwa to sɛ "gyina" biara amma a

calls.h1_f:
POST /api/frɛ/{dan_id}/fi ase {video, ɔdio} → frɛ_id
WS broadcast {type:"c", ɔkwan:"to nsa frɛ", frɛ_id}
WS broadcast {type:"c", ɔkwan:"ɔde ma", sdp}
WS broadcast {type:"c", ɔkwan:"mmuae", sdp}
WS broadcast {type:"c", ɔkwan:"ɔkannifo", nsukyenee} × N
POST /api/frɛ/{frɛ_id}/awie

stealth.h4_f:
DoH: POST https://mununkum-dns.com/dns-asɛmmisa {edin: x.vortexx.sol}
ECH: ClientHello.extensions += encrypted_sni (ɔmanfo_safoa_fi_HTTPS_kyerɛwtohɔ)
DGA: domain (t) = base32( SHA256(aba ∥ YYYY-MM-DD) )[:16] + ".nhwɛso".

push.h4_f:
iOS NSE: didReceive (abisade) { decrypt (abisade. nsɛm a ɛwɔ mu.ɔdefoInfo) }
Android FCM: onMessageReceived(akyirikyiriNkrasɛm) { decrypt (akyirikyiriNkrasɛm.data) }
Wɛb SW: self.addEventListener ('pia', e => decrypt (e.data)) .

bots.h1_f:
bɔ: POST /api/bots {ɔdefo din, ɔyɛkyerɛ_din, koodu}
          → {bot_id, agyiraehyɛde, pubkey}
run: wɔ-adwuma mu (coroutine mu node) .
      OR abɔnten (tenten-poll / api / bots / {id} / updates, token-auth'd)
nkra: {nsɛm, nsaano nkyerɛwee: Ed25519-Sign (bot_priv, canonical_msg)}

security.h4_f:
canary.txt (da biara da):
  {da, sig: Ed25519-Sign (wɔayi_priv, da)}
client verifies → enni hɔ anaasɛ enni mu ⇒ compromise suspected

ntɛmpɛ:
  admin POST /api/admin/twa-ne nyinaa {ntease}
  node broadcasts {type:"n", adeyɛ:"agyae", ntease}
  clients popa safe, hyɛ re-bootstrap

